[h1]Better Journal UI — Changelog[/h1]

One bullet per change. Newest first.

Keep every entry short and non-technical: what actually changes for the player in the game.

[hr][/hr]
[h2]1.0[/h2]
[list]
[*]First release: the Journal gets a gold-framed background with cut-in corners, all the time. Its opacity is set in Options - Mods, where it can also be switched to solid dark navy.
[*]The Journal is hidden completely while it has no goals to show, instead of leaving an empty title.
[/list]
